WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.667
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.669
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.971
and now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.971 --> 00:00:07.906
Happy New Year, everybody!

00:00:07.906 --> 00:00:10.777
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:13.179
Saturday was New Year's Day.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.782
As to what year,
it's anyone's guess.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:17.150
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.053
Eric Adams was sworn in
as the mayor of New York City

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:22.221
shortly after midnight
on New Year's Eve

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:24.757
in Times Square.
It was a nice gesture

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:27.627
to let Mayor de Blasio
drop the ball one last time.

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:29.395
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:32.264
That's right, Eric Adams was
sworn in on Saturday

00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:34.267
as New York City's 110th mayor.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.535
Wow, just think!

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.369
One day, he, too,

00:00:37.369 --> 00:00:39.005
might never be president.

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:41.507
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:42.942
President Biden spoke yesterday

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:45.245
with Ukrainian
President Zelensky

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:47.379
and said that the U.S.
and its allies will

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:51.551
"respond decisively if Russia
further invades Ukraine,"

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.787
which is sort of like
your parents threatening

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:55.454
to ground you, if they find

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:58.091
any more crack
in your sock drawer.

00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:00.159
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:01.694
President Biden
announced recently

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.463
that the government
would provide Americans

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:06.099
with 500 million free
rapid coronavirus tests.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:09.135
And, to save time,
they come pre-positive.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:13.472
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:15.441
That way, you don't have to wait
the 15 minutes.

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:16.943
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.111
According to the latest numbers,
the U.S. is averaging more

00:01:19.111 --> 00:01:22.782
than 386,000 new cases
of the coronavirus each day.

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:23.850
Wow, that's crazy --

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:29.022
386,000 people managed
to get tested?

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:30.757
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.126
The CDC announced recently
that it has shortened

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:34.894
the recommended time
that people quarantine

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:36.929
after testing positive
for the coronavirus,

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:38.765
from 10 days to 5 days.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.633
They added that today is
basically over,

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:41.934
so, it's really four days.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.503
Plus, Sundays don't count,
so three day--

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:45.204
You know what?
Just take the weekend.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.538
[ Laughter and applause ]
Just take the weekend.

00:01:46.538 --> 00:01:48.274
You'll be fine.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:51.845
Tesla has issued a recall
for nearly 500,000 cars,

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:53.712
due to two separate defects.

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:56.949
No word on whether Time magazine
is also planning

00:01:56.949 --> 00:01:58.117
to issue a recall.

00:01:58.117 --> 00:01:59.919
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:02.889
Just 12 days
after it was released,

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:06.525
"Spider-Man: No Way Home"
has made over $1 billion

00:02:06.525 --> 00:02:08.894
[ Cheering and applause ]
and three --

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:10.496
three new variants.

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:13.933
[ Laughter, ohs, and applause ]

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.401
Papa John's recently added

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:17.737
a New York-style pizza
to its menu that features

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:20.839
eight large slices
that customers can fold to eat.

00:02:20.839 --> 00:02:23.843
But, hey, unless you can
drunkenly pay for it

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.645
with a Ziploc bag full
of nickels

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.780
and then fall asleep eating it
on the subway,

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.848
it's not New York-style.

00:02:29.848 --> 00:02:31.484
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.252
And, finally,
authorities in Florida

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:36.021
recently arrested a man
during a traffic stop,

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:39.725
when they allegedly found
cocaine and crystal meth wrapped

00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:42.628
around his penis,
or, as it's known there,

00:02:42.628 --> 00:02:44.196
a Jacksonville condom.

00:02:44.196 --> 00:02:46.232
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:52.304
And that was the monologue.

00:02:52.304 --> 00:02:53.473
It's nice.

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:55.408
[ Cheering and applause ]
You know it's nice.

00:02:59.578 --> 00:03:02.015
You want to like
start off the year

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:03.916
with some insane news
out of Florida

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:06.819
and that was just really nice
of that gentleman

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.721
to wrap his penis
in crystal meth.

00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:09.722
[ Laughter ]

